### MBTA Casino — API Collection
### Extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
###
### REST Client stores session cookies automatically in a per-workspace jar.
### Run "Register / re-issue session" first — the cookie carries through all
### subsequent requests. You'll need to re-run it after restarting VS Code.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json


# ── Auth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register / re-issue session  ← run this first
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

###

### Whoami
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


# ── Routes & Stations ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all routes
GET {{baseUrl}}/routes

###

### List all stations
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations

###

### List stations on the Red Line
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations?route_id=Red

###

### List stations on the Green-B branch
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations?route_id=Green-B


# ── Predictions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Station IDs are stable after seeding (run manage.py sync_stations).
### Park Street = 8, Downtown Crossing = 9, South Station = 10

### Predictions at Park Street (Red + all Green branches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations/8/predictions

###

### Predictions at Downtown Crossing (Red + Orange)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations/9/predictions

###

### Predictions at South Station (Red)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stations/10/predictions

###

### Single prediction status — replace {id} with an id from the list above
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions/168/status


# ── Bets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Not yet implemented — stubs for when the endpoints land.

### Place a bet  ← replace prediction_id with one from a predictions response
POST {{baseUrl}}/bets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "prediction_id": 1895,
  "direction": "BEFORE",
  "amount": 100
}

###

### Active bet (returns null if none)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bets/active

###

### Bet history (paginated resolved bets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bets/history
